ass=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's a little introverted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She enjoys eating sunflower seeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height 159cm, Measurements 81/62/87</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049100/extras/ff94030a2f263d675082fbace6204faa.avif?t=1767956611\" width=473 height=216 /></span>Age 7 \u2192 8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Sis, buy me ice cream! Ice cream!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She follows her sister to the big city. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's bubbly and upbeat, but never afraid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's still a child, so she doesn't really understand what's going on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height 128cm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049100/extras/8717629d31929da9baae343c351c8622.avif?t=1767956611\" width=473 height=216 /></span>Age 21 \u2192 22</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Many people still have a lot to deal with. Like you and me.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She grew up in Tokyo. Her family is involved in the real estate business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She employs both main characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's nice and approachable, but she can put her foot down when needs be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height 165cm, Measurements 89/60/90</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049100/extras/639d25e24c53750c3f9e369ce6bd6d48.avif?t=1767956611\" width=473 height=216 /></span>Age 37 \u2192 38</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;I don't do stuff that doesn't earn money.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He came to Japan twenty years earlier from China.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For various reasons, he keeps trying to push dangerous jobs on Jing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of his business is in nightclubs and land speculation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049100/extras/8f6af0ebb300faefa178ae96af44bad9.avif?t=1767956611\" width=473 height=216 /></span>Age ???</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A black cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He lives in the old station building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He seems friendly, but runs away if you try to catch him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049100/extras/45ee0304a2987b41d16166821aba89a8.avif?t=1767956611\" width=623 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000<strong>Original Story \u00b7 Scenario: </strong>Tomo Kataoka</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000<strong>Concept Art: </strong>Werkbau</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000<strong>Character Art: </strong>Werkbau, Ringo, Takehiko Akino, Yatumi Suzuame</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000<strong>Scene Art: </strong>Ringo, forfreedo, Kyarumii</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000<strong>Cast: </strong>M.N.H, Hiroko Taguchi, Kaori Nazuka, Yuko Goto, Jin Li, Tomoe Tamiyasu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000<strong>Music: </strong>bermei.inazawa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000<strong>OP Vocal: </strong>Annabel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000<strong>BGM Vocal \u00b7 Chorus: </strong>lasah, Raheem &quot;Mega Ran&quot; Jarbo, Mari Yura, Annabel, Shouichi Taguchi, Mashiro Shirakami</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000<strong>LOGO Design: </strong>Nachi Kio (KOME WORKS)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000<strong>UI Design: </strong>Mu Xia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000<strong>Visual Design: </strong>C.I.C, Mu Xia\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000<strong>Movie: </strong>C.I.C, Yazi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000<strong>Performance \u00b7 Script: </strong>2B, Koraku</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000<strong>Program: </strong>Xiao Ai 363</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000<strong>Operation \u00b7 PR: </strong>Xue Han</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000<strong>Web Design: </strong>Yume Amamiya, Shi Jiu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000<strong>Planner \u00b7 Director \u00b7 Producer: </strong>Koraku</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3000\u3000English Localization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000<strong>Translation: </strong>Holm Hinners</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000<strong>Editing: </strong>tyabann</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000<strong>Script Insertion: </strong>Alice Davidson</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000<strong>Image Editing: </strong>Liew Shan Yuan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000<strong>Quality Assurance: </strong>R. Stuart</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000<strong>Project Manager: </strong>John Baumlin, PMP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000<strong>General Manager: </strong>Koji Hotta</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000<strong>Beta Testers: </strong>Dizzy Valiel, arccun, Cassandra Hockaday</p>","developers":["Koraku"